# =============================================================================
# Computation Theory App — Environment Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT:
# - NEVER commit real API keys or secrets to version control.
# - Copy this file to '.env.local' for local development.
# - All keys listed below are strictly SERVER-SIDE only.
# - DO NOT prefix these keys with 'NEXT_PUBLIC_' as that would expose them to the client bundle.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Vision Recognition Providers for Image-Based Solver
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If neither key is provided, the application runs 100% offline using the built-in
# local heuristic parser, deterministic table/graph layout engine, and editable confirmation screen.

# Option 1: Google Gemini Vision API (Recommended for diagrams and handwriting)
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Option 2: OpenAI GPT-4o Vision API
# Get your key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Provider Preference (optional: 'gemini' | 'openai')
# If both keys are present, defaults to 'gemini' unless specified here:
VISION_PROVIDER=gemini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Development & Testing Flags
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional mock JSON response used by CI/CD test runners to simulate vision output
# without incurring network calls or API costs.
# MOCK_VISION_RESPONSE=
